      "{**20 NY3d at 571} OPINION OF THE COURT",
      " I concur in the result, and write separately because I believe the majority incorrectly concludes that the expert testimony was properly admitted under our prior decision in  (16 NY3d 441 [2011]) and today's decision in People v Williams (20 NY3d 579 [2013]).{**20 NY3d at 577} ",
      "On the issue of the preclusion of testimony by Mr. Martinez, I agree with the majority that the preclusion was reversible error, and therefore concur in affirming the Appellate Division's order, reversing and remitting for a new trial.{**20 NY3d at 578} "
